===Etymology===
From earlier {{m-lite|ryu|sc=Jpan||水|tr=midu → midzu → mizu}}, attested in 1711 in the {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|混効験集|tr=Konkōkenshū}}, itself from {{inh-lite|ryu|jpx-ryu-pro|sc=Latnx|*medu|sort=みじ}}.

The word underwent a pronunciation change due to the shifting of {{IPAchar-lite|/u/}} to {{IPAchar-lite|/i/}} after alveolar consonants.

Cognate with {{cog-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|水|tr=mizu}}, {{cog-lite|ojp|sc=Jpan|水|tr=mi<sub>1</sub>du}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ryu-pron|みずぃ|acc=1|acc_ref=OGJ}}

